WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.360
- Whenever people come together to work,

00:00:02.360 --> 00:00:05.500
you can be sure that
at some point in time,

00:00:05.500 --> 00:00:08.230
there's going to be a
problem that comes up.

00:00:08.230 --> 00:00:10.200
Some conflicts will arise and sooner

00:00:10.200 --> 00:00:12.620
or later you will be in
a position that you need

00:00:12.620 --> 00:00:15.530
to solve these kind of
critical situations.

00:00:15.530 --> 00:00:17.510
This is a challenge for many people,

00:00:17.510 --> 00:00:19.600
especially for young professionals.

00:00:19.600 --> 00:00:20.830
Many people don't want

00:00:20.830 --> 00:00:23.270
to confront other people face to face,

00:00:23.270 --> 00:00:25.310
they would rather prefer harmony

00:00:25.310 --> 00:00:27.880
and not needing to put
themselves out there

00:00:27.880 --> 00:00:30.280
to have these difficult conversations.

00:00:30.280 --> 00:00:31.113
But of course,

00:00:31.113 --> 00:00:33.270
these difficult
conversations are important

00:00:33.270 --> 00:00:35.640
and often just needs to take place

00:00:35.640 --> 00:00:38.560
and during my time as a
consultant at McKinsey,

00:00:38.560 --> 00:00:41.440
I learned a simple
principle that was aimed

00:00:41.440 --> 00:00:43.680
to guide young consultants in how

00:00:43.680 --> 00:00:47.400
to confront clients how
to handle challenging

00:00:47.400 --> 00:00:49.533
and sensitive situations at work.

